#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186283900 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "55a53010-eddc-5115-8c70-0f32d0144384" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Points of Intersection of a Hyperbola and a Line"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3cdf9991-54c0-5907-b4c4-386c77f27b9c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186283902}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3cdf9991-54c0-5907-b4c4-386c77f27b9c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186283902} :answer-field/id #uuid "6d4c7cc2-2d02-5c8a-a77e-2125403b00b7" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186283901} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cc988383-1e89-5565-9753-3d079cedb0fb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186283904}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cc988383-1e89-5565-9753-3d079cedb0fb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186283904} :answer-field/id #uuid "84db0e4a-cac2-5576-81dd-9da53bef1cd8" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186283903}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "51629e1f-11aa-5026-a109-70d1b9705db2" :question/math-academy-id "q-277805" :question/problem "In **ascending order,** the $x$-coordinates of the points where the hyperbola $3{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}=8$ intersects the line $y=x$ are\n\n$\\,x=$\n{{field-1}}$\\,$ and $\\,x=$\n{{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "To find the points where the hyperbola intersects the line $y=x,$ we first replace $y$ with $x$ in the equation of the hyperbola and solve for $x,$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}^{2}-{y}^{2} & =8 \\\\ 3{x}^{2}-{x}^{2} & =8 \\\\ 2{x}^{2} & =8 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =4 \\\\ x & =\\pm 2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, in ascending order, the $x$-coordinates of the points of intersection are\n$x=-2$ and $x=2.$"}]}
